    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DEMO v1 AVAILABLE NOW!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo v2 coming... soon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's Ribby: The Game! An RPG/Visual Novel hybrid about acceptance, friends, and frogs! Ribbit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the story of Ribecca &quot;Ribby&quot; Brown, an altruistic frog girl on a journey to get back home - hoping to make some friends along the way and discover things she doesn't yet know about herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Looking inward is always a daunting task, especially when you're afraid of what you'll find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742740/extras/07384c89e68035f817084c2155a6c687.poster.avif?t=1746918867\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742740/extras/07384c89e68035f817084c2155a6c687.apng?t=1746918867\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742740/extras/cb4c2c2a3f3f0ceb93b90154439a050d.poster.avif?t=1746918867\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742740/extras/cb4c2c2a3f3f0ceb93b90154439a050d.apng?t=1746918867\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>  what r they talkin bout...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Warning: This game may make you feel like:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smiling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Having fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Telling ALL of your friends about it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kissing someone right on the mouth</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
